  "description": "Charles Sturt University is Australia’s largest regional university and can be traced back to 1895 before being fully incorporated as a university in 1989.Embracing First Nation wisdom, our university upholds the Wiradjuri phase \"yindyamarra winhanganha\" as our guiding ethos – meaning “the wisdom of respectfully knowing how to live well in a world worth living in\".Pioneering sustainability, our university proudly earned the title of Australia’s first certified carbon neutral university in 2016‡, embodying a commitment to creating a better future for all.Charles Sturt University Sydney is our university’s only metro location. Situated in the vibrant heart of North Sydney, the campus is within easy reach of the iconic Sydney Harbour, bustling CBD and famous beaches.Our new, purpose-built campus offers the perfect blend of modern amenities and academic excellence. Along with a wide range of support services, you’ll have everything you need to commence an exciting career and establish lifelong connections. Timestamps Updated",
